---
# [claude-site-structure] List page layout, built with assistance from Claude (Anthropic), October 8, 2026.
# Shows one article card per item in a collection, newest first, two columns on desktop and one on mobile,
# under a black Bungee heading.
# The list page sets `listOf` to a collection name: anecdote, case-study, note or about.
# Any markdown body on the list page is shown above the cards as an introduction.
layout: layout-base.njk
stylesheet: /css/article.css
---
    <main class="card-list">
        <h2 class="collection-title">{{ title }}</h2>
        {{ content | safe }}
        <div class="card-grid">
            {%- for item in collections[listOf] | newestFirst %}
            {%- set card = item | toCard %}
            {% include "article-card.njk" %}
            {%- else %}
            <p>Nothing here yet.</p>
            {%- endfor %}
        </div>
    </main>
